    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d884">

                <pb facs="0915" n="903" sameAs="frus:frus1945v08/pg903"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890F.20 Missions/5–3045: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Minister in Saudi Arabia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Eddy</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-05-30T19:00:00-04:00">May 30, 1945—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>151. Colonel Connor’s preliminary report has been presented to War. Before he can
                    make his final report and before a directive can be issued to General Giles for
                    negotiations made through you re technical <pb facs="0916" n="904"
                        xml:id="pg904"/> details of proposed installations it will be necessary to
                    ascertain final wishes of King Abdul Aziz re organization of mission. Please
                    state when it can be expected that King’s decision will be received.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
